#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/fade_in.rst:51
msgid ""
"This effect/filter fades in the source similar to the :doc:`Wipe </"
"compositing/transitions/wipe>` transition. A checkbox switches to fade from "
"black. It used to be called \"Fade from Black\"."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter zosilňuje zdroj podobne ako prechod :doc:`Wipe </"
"compositing/transitions/wipe>`. Zaškrtávacie políčko prepína na prelínanie z "
"čiernej. Predtým sa nazýval „Fade from Black\"."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/fade_in.rst:53
msgid ""
"This effect does not have keyframes but a slider controlling the duration of "
"the fade."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt nemá kľúčové snímky, ale má posuvník, ktorý riadi trvanie "
"zosilňovania."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/fade_in.rst:55
msgid "The applied easing method curve is shown on the clips fade."
msgstr "Použitá krivka metódy uvoľnenia je zobrazená na prelínaní klipu."

